{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013BAV55K55eoh7FLE6wnnTs","type":"tool_result","content":"e12d49bf fix(pose): say every check was carried only when none ran or was skipped; run closeout-check over a carried record\nbfb9add3 docs(pose): start the carry report and closeout coverage spec\n0e05c598 feat(pose): report carried checks apart and test a carried record through closeout\n1f83c1fb docs(pose): specify the review-convergence and validation follow-ups\n.pose/starts/pose-worktree-runtime-qos-and-measurement.json\n.pose/starts/pose-worktree-runtime-resident-cache.json\n.pose/starts/pose-writer-coordination-and-atomic-publication.json\n{\n  \"_comment\": \"Staleness/refresh policy for the native project-state artifact (specs pose-project-state-artifact, pose-project-state-refresh-contract). Optional: absent means pose-mcp uses these same defaults. max_age_days is checked against generated_at; max_commits is checked against baseline_commit via `git rev-list --count`, when a git repo is available. strict_refresh: false means a failed automatic refresh (post-event hook) never blocks the command that triggered it — it marks refresh_pending in the state frontmatter instead; true makes that failure block the triggering command.\",","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"[private-session]","uuid":"04edc59b-64f7-4988-a18f-cd7d6231771e","timestamp":"2026-11-28T14:48:05.684Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"e12d49bf fix(pose): say every check was carried only when none ran or was skipped; run closeout-check over a carried record\nbfb9add3 docs(pose): start the carry report and closeout coverage spec\n0e05c598 feat(pose): report carried checks apart and test a carried record through closeout\n1f83c1fb docs(pose): specify the review-convergence and validation follow-ups\n.pose/starts/pose-worktree-runtime-qos-and-measurement.json\n.pose/starts/pose-worktree-runtime-resident-cache.json\n.pose/starts/pose-writer-coordination-and-atomic-publication.json\n{\n  \"_comment\": \"Staleness/refresh policy for the native project-state artifact (specs pose-project-state-artifact, pose-project-state-refresh-contract). Optional: absent means pose-mcp uses these same defaults. max_age_days is checked against generated_at; max_commits is checked against baseline_commit via `git rev-list --count`, when a git repo is available. strict_refresh: false means a failed automatic refresh (post-event hook) never blocks the command that triggered it — it marks refresh_pending in the state frontmatter instead; true makes that failure block the triggering command.\",","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_013BAV55K55eoh7FLE6wnnTs","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
