iew_by\":\"2026-12-15\"},' '{\"id\":\"N10\",\"severity\":\"low\",\"disposition\":\"follow-up\",\"file\":\".pose/specs/2026-11-22-pose-validate-carries-unchanged-checks.md\",\"line\":264,\"summary\":\"Remainder of R1-N3: F1 and F2 of the origin spec are still [open] (lines 264-265) and pose followups still lists both, although R4 says this spec closes them.\",\"action\":\"At closeout of this spec, set F1 and F2 of the origin spec to a closing disposition (covered by this spec, or done), as other closed specs have had follow-ups updated.\",\"owner\":\"@pose-maintainers\",\"review_by\":\"2026-12-15\"}' '],' '\"prior_findings\":[' '{\"id\":\"R1-N1\",\"status\":\"fixed\",\"evidence\":\"pose-mcp/internal/cli/report.go:330 reportListsACheck guards the note; TestCarryReportListsCarriedChecksApart covers the mixed case and passed; a real carry run with a skipped check and carried checks (temporary go test overlay, ZZProbe4) no longer says every check was carried.\"},' '{\"id\":\"R1-N2\",\"status\":\"fixed\",\"evidence\":\"review_closeout_test.go now calls cmdCloseoutCheck and asserts closeout.terminal=true; go test -run ACarriedRecordIsSealedVerifiedAndClosed passed; R3 was reworded to a record in the carry shape with decision D1 giving the reason. Residual wording and coverage point is N9.\"},' '{\"id\":\"R1-N3\",\"status\":\"partial\",\"evidence\":\"Spec line 115 traces R4 to the spec Follow-ups instead of an unrelated test; pose followups still lists two open items of pose-validate-carries-unchanged-checks. Remainder recorded as N10.\"},' '{\"id\":\"R1-N4\",\"status\":\"fixed\",\"evidence\":\"git diff c1e3716f 41668709 shows the Carried checks paragraph of POSE.md, locales/pt-BR/POSE.md and both embedded copies describing the report section and the all-carried note; go test ./internal/scaffold/... passed.\"},' '{\"id\":\"R1-N5\",\"status\":\"fixed\",\"evidence\":\"validate_carry_test.go now checks the three headings before slicing, asserts the carried outcome and absence from Results, and has the time import in order; the test passed. The remaining gofmt difference at line 594 predates this scope.\"},' '{\"id\":\"R1-N6\",\"status\":\"fixed\",\"evidence\":\"validate.go appends the skip reason and exit code to the carried line; a real carry run (ZZProbe4) printed the carried failing check with exit=3. Missing test is N8.\"}' '],' '\"sweep\":\"All eight subject files and the spec: validationSummaryOf, renderReportMarkdown, reportListsACheck, the report callers, the delivery reader and evidence currency rules, both new tests, the four manual copies, requirement trace, D1, amendments lint, origin follow-ups; focused carry, report, delivery reader and scaffold tests, go vet of internal/cli, real carry report probes, and the planned pose checks.\",' '\"criteria\":[' '{\"id\":\"assumption-integrity\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"Verified: CarriedFrom separates carried from executed checks and the delivery reader takes the carried head and time. D1 states that the fixture record is hand-written with a placeholder provenance digest. Residual: material-binding currency of a carried record is not exercised end to end and D1 overstates the change-set shape (N9).\"},' '{\"id\":\"backend-concurrency\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\"},' '{\"id\":\"backend-contracts\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"integration:pose-mcp/go/delivery-integration\"},' '{\"id\":\"backend-input-errors\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\"},' '{\"id\":\"backend-integration-impact\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"integration:pose-mcp/go/delivery-integration\"},' '{\"id\":\"backend-observability\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\"},' '{\"id\":\"compatibility\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"The added Carried Checks section is declared by the spec and documented; runs without carried checks render as before; log parsing, report history and result schema are unchanged.\"},' '{\"id\":\"correctness\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\"},' '{\"id\":\"design-causality\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"structure:design-2af3a9d87fc09bb9\",\"rationale\":\"The cause was the summary treating every check as executed; branching on CarriedFrom before commands and results are built meets R1 and R2, and D1 gives the basis for the R3 fixture shape. The design assessment lists no structural delta.\"},' '{\"id\":\"documentation\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"Read the changed paragraph in the English, pt-BR and embedded manuals; it matches the observed report: carried section, absence from commands and results, and the all-carried statement.\"},' '{\"id\":\"operability\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"Carried lines name outcome, check, source head, time, and skip reason or exit code. The placeholder wording in a carried and skipped run is N7.\"},' '{\"id\":\"requirements\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\"},' '{\"id\":\"scope\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"Changes are the declared artifacts; carry eligibility and selection are untouched. R3 was reworded after round 1 with decision D1; spec lint reports no amendment failure. The origin follow-up disposition remains (N10).\"},' '{\"id\":\"security\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"No new input, path or authority: fields come from the repository canonical result already used as carry base and are only written to the report; sealing rules are unchanged.\"},' '{\"id\":\"solution-proportionality\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"One summary field, one report section and 