:406,\"summary\":\"When no command ran, at least one check was carried and another was skipped, Validation Commands reads _Fill manually_ in an automatic report instead of saying nothing ran. Reproduced with a real validate --carry --report run.\",\"action\":\"State that no command was executed for a structured run with carried and skipped checks only.\",\"owner\":\"@pose-maintainers\",\"review_by\":\"2026-12-15\"},\n{\"id\":\"N8\",\"severity\":\"low\",\"disposition\":\"follow-up\",\"file\":\"pose-mcp/internal/cli/validate.go\",\"line\":1629,\"summary\":\"No test builds a carried check with a skip reason or exit code, so removing the R1-N6 fix would not fail the tests read in this round. The exit code was observed in a real run.\",\"action\":\"Assert the skip reason and exit code on carried lines.\",\"owner\":\"@pose-maintainers\",\"review_by\":\"2026-12-15\"},\n{\"id\":\"N9\",\"severity\":\"low\",\"disposition\":\"follow-up\",\"file\":\".pose/specs/2026-11-23-pose-validate-carry-report-and-closeout-coverage.md\",\"line\":92,\"summary\":\"D1 says the fixture carries from a change-set commit as a real carry does, but a real carry takes the base record head, which need not belong to the spec, and real records carry material and scope provenance that govern currency. No end-to-end case read in this round seals a carried check through the material binding.\",\"action\":\"Correct the D1 wording or add a carried-record case with material provenance.\",\"owner\":\"@pose-maintainers\",\"review_by\":\"2026-12-15\"},\n{\"id\":\"N10\",\"severity\":\"low\",\"disposition\":\"follow-up\",\"file\":\".pose/specs/2026-11-22-pose-validate-carries-unchanged-checks.md\",\"line\":264,\"summary\":\"Remainder of R1-N3: F1 and F2 of the origin spec are still [open] (lines 264-265) and pose followups still lists both, although R4 says this spec closes them.\",\"action\":\"At closeout of this spec, set F1 and F2 of the origin spec to a closing disposition (covered by this spec, or done), as other closed specs have had follow-ups updated.\",\"owner\":\"@pose-maintainers\",\"review_by\":\"2026-12-15\"}\n],\n\"prior_findings\":[\n{\"id\":\"R1-N1\",\"status\":\"fixed\",\"evidence\":\"pose-mcp/internal/cli/report.go:330 reportListsACheck guards the note; TestCarryReportListsCarriedChecksApart covers the mixed case and passed; a real carry run with a skipped check and carried checks (temporary go test overlay, ZZProbe4) no longer says every check was carried.\"},\n{\"id\":\"R1-N2\",\"status\":\"fixed\",\"evidence\":\"review_closeout_test.go now calls cmdCloseoutCheck and asserts closeout.terminal=true; go test -run ACarriedRecordIsSealedVerifiedAndClosed passed; R3 was reworded to a record in the carry shape with decision D1 giving the reason. Residual wording and coverage point is N9.\"},\n{\"id\":\"R1-N3\",\"status\":\"partial\",\"evidence\":\"Spec line 115 traces R4 to the spec Follow-ups instead of an unrelated test; pose followups still lists two open items of pose-validate-carries-unchanged-checks. Remainder recorded as N10.\"},\n{\"id\":\"R1-N4\",\"status\":\"fixed\",\"evidence\":\"git diff c1e3716f 41668709 shows the Carried checks paragraph of POSE.md, locales/pt-BR/POSE.md and both embedded copies describing the report section and the all-carried note; go test ./internal/scaffold/... passed.\"},\n{\"id\":\"R1-N5\",\"status\":\"fixed\",\"evidence\":\"validate_carry_test.go now checks the three headings before slicing, asserts the carried outcome and absence from Results, and has the time import in order; the test passed. The remaining gofmt difference at line 594 predates this scope.\"},\n{\"id\":\"R1-N6\",\"status\":\"fixed\",\"evidence\":\"validate.go appends the skip reason and exit code to the carried line; a real carry run (ZZProbe4) printed the carried failing check with exit=3. Missing test is N8.\"}\n],\n\"sweep\":\"All eight subject files and the spec: validationSummaryOf, renderReportMarkdown, reportListsACheck, the report callers, the delivery reader and evidence currency rules, both new tests, the four manual copies, requirement trace, D1, amendments lint, origin follow-ups; focused carry, report, delivery reader and scaffold tests, go vet of internal/cli, real carry report probes, and the planned pose checks.\",\n\"criteria\":[\n{\"id\":\"assumption-integrity\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"Verified: CarriedFrom separates carried from executed checks and the delivery reader takes the carried head and time. D1 states that the fixture record is hand-written with a placeholder provenance digest. Residual: material-binding currency of a carried record is not exercised end to end and D1 overstates the change-set shape (N9).\"},\n{\"id\":\"backend-concurrency\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\"},\n{\"id\":\"backend-contracts\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"integration:pose-mcp/go/delivery-integration\"},\n{\"id\":\"backend-input-errors\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\"},\n{\"id\":\"backend-integration-impact\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"integration:pose-mcp/go/delivery-integration\"},\n{\"id\":\"backend-observability\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\"},\n{\"id\":\"compatibility\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"The added Carried Checks section is declared by the spec and documented; runs without carried checks render as before; log parsing, report history and result schema are unchanged.\"},\n{\"id\":\"correctness\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\"},\n{\"id\":\"design-causality\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"structure:design-2af3a9d87fc09bb9\",\"rationale\":\"The cause was the summary treating every check as executed; branching on CarriedFrom before commands and results are built meets R1 and R2, and D1 gives the basis for the R3 fixture shape. The design assessment lists no structural delta.\"},\n{\"id\":\"documentation\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"Read the changed paragraph in the English, pt-BR and embedded manuals; it matches the observed report: carried section, absence from commands and results, and the all-carried statement.\"},\n{\"id\":\"operability\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"Carried lines name outcome, check, source head, time, and skip reason or exit code. The placeholder wording in a carried and skipped run is N7.\"},\n{\"id\":\"requirements\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\"},\n{\"id\":\"scope\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"Changes are the declared artifacts; carry eligibility and selection are untouched. R3 was reworded after round 1 with decision D1; spec lint reports no amendment failure. The origin follow-up disposition remains (N10).\"},\n{\"id\":\"security\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"No new input, path or authority: fields come from the repository canonical result already used as carry base and are only written to the report; sealing rules are unchanged.\"},\n{\"id\":\"solution-proportionality\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"One summary field, one report section and a small guard are sufficient. The guard depends on the result line prefix produced by validationSummaryOf and would need revisiting if that shape changed.\"}\n],\n\"tools\":[\n{\"id\":\"artifact-check\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"command:pose artifact-check --spec pose-validate-carry-report-and-closeout-coverage --strict\",\"rationale\":\"Exit 0; it also lists repository-wide warnings.\"},\n{\"id\":\"assess-design\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"structure:design-2af3a9d87fc09bb9\"},\n{\"id\":\"assess-discover\",\"component\":\"pose-mcp\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"command:pose assess discover --no-persist --component pose-mcp\"},\n{\"id\":\"assess-integrate\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"integration:pose-mcp/go/delivery-integration\",\"rationale\":\"Run with --no-persist; three HTTP routes with no observed consumer, unrelated to this change.\"},\n{\"id\":\"assess-tech-debt\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"command:pose assess tech-debt --no-persist\",\"rationale\":\"Scan reported INCOMPLETE because two unrelated specs could not be read.\"},\n{\"id\":\"closeout-check\",\"disposition\":\"deferred\",\"rationale\":\"Run, exit 1: review not yet recorded and lifecycle not done.\"},\n{\"id\":\"review-check\",\"disposition\":\"deferred\",\"rationale\":\"Run, exit 1: no approval exists before this conclusion; the checkout reports no sealed bundle for its current inputs.\"},\n{\"id\":\"suggest-review\",\"component\":\"pose-mcp\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"command:pose suggest review --path pose-mcp\"},\n{\"id\":\"surface-check\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"integration:pose-mcp/go/delivery-integration\",\"rationale\":\"Run with --strict: exit 0, 0 findings.\"},\n{\"id\":\"validate\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"Not rerun by this reviewer, to stay inside the run time budget; relies on the sealed result. Focused tests were run and passed.\"},\n{\"id\":\"validate\",\"component\":\"pose-mcp\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"Not rerun by this reviewer; relies on the sealed result. Focused tests and go vet of internal/cli were run without failure.\"}\n]}\n```","ttft_ms":1589,"type":"result","duration_ms":641604,"uuid":"62871fbd-f564-4cfb-9574-1bfd4acee6cd","ttft_stream_ms":897,"time_to_request_ms":66,"first_content_frame_ms":897,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":